          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listening …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ich möchte jetzt kochen. Was muss ich bereitlegen, und was ist der erste Schritt?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I want to start cooking now. What do I need to get ready, and what's the first step?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ich will kein Gejammer hören! Ich will hören: JAWOHL, SIR! Lauter!": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't want to hear whining! I want to hear: SIR, YES SIR! Louder!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ich zähle nicht für dich, Rekrut! Zähl selbst, und zwar LAUT!": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm not counting for you, recruit! Count yourself, and count LOUD!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
